  "rationale": "The test profile sets sample_inference to 'independent'; switching to 'pooled' makes DADA2_DENOISING run dada() with pool = TRUE, so ASV inference uses all samples together. DADA2_ERR and the upstream preprocessing and trimming steps are unchanged. Every step downstream of denoising receives a new ASV table and sequences and must rerun: chimera removal, merging, clustering, decontamination, filtering, taxonomy, QIIME2 analyses, R objects and the reports. MultiQC and the summary report also change, because the parameter summary and the reported sample_inference value differ."
